#: core/DialogAbout.qml:77
msgctxt "DialogAbout|"
msgid "<b>GCompris</b> is a Free Software developed within the KDE community."
msgstr ""
"Tha <b>GCompris</b> ’na bhathar-bog an-asgaidh a tha ’ga leasachadh am "
